---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Eran Gamage - AI and Data Science">
  <section class="fade-up space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <p class="eyebrow">Physics, data science, and applied AI</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl">
        Eran Gamage
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
        I am a physics-trained data science researcher working on practical AI systems, retrieval-augmented generation, NLP evaluation, Australian energy grid analytics, privacy-preserving retrieval protocols, and climate modelling.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/projects">View Projects</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-14 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
    <article class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Applied AI</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">RAG and NLP evaluation</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 muted-copy">
        Retrieval, answer grounding, and evaluation workflows for practical information systems.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Energy</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">Australian grid analytics</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 muted-copy">
        Forecasting and analysis using AEMO and NEM datasets with reproducible ML pipelines.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">Privacy-preserving retrieval</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 muted-copy">
        Notes and experiments around private queries, proofs, and retrieval-oriented protocol design.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 card">
    <p class="eyebrow">Current focus</p>
    <p class="mt-3 muted-copy">
      I am interested in small, dependable systems that connect research methods with real datasets: clear baselines, careful evaluation, and outputs that can be checked.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
